{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_4000_situation", "source_sha256": "1a1325069295ee028233200de67c841fde3f39ff618b9b1e4959be1283dd0f4e", "ja": "プラネタリウム番組　休憩中", "zh": "天文节目　休息中", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_4000_place", "source_sha256": "2f5b5c6a3a61964a4291742b4db0102b5415d6c924d155008d6906c21662343a", "ja": "プラネタリウム", "zh": "天象馆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_4001_p", "source_sha256": "d9ced98a47a219a087f1f344f064b15c58197d4ecb3dd93635a8a798e477ac7b", "ja": "（貴音のきれいな声が、スクリーンの星空に響く……。\n今日は、天文解説のナレーターの仕事だ）", "zh": "（贵音的美声响彻了整个投影的星空……\n她今天的工作是天文解说员。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_4002_008tak", "source_sha256": "091cdf561ab843520ddb859c901675bf423613aba9b21fef952739352cfe87e7", "ja": "ふふ、このような仕事にめぐりあえるとは、\n真、幸運でした。", "zh": "呵呵，能与这样的工作相遇，\n着实幸运。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_4003_p", "source_sha256": "29ffd5f9c804a3aa3642955a449530b242c58ca6e8b8464588da6afdbb371a9b", "ja": "そういえば、貴音の趣味は天体観測だったな。", "zh": "这么说来，贵音的兴趣是天文观测啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_4004_008tak", "source_sha256": "b7c957883fda18ac30481d41c08d951c13bb20619d9d3bf3d4a285e620be98f0", "ja": "はい。夜空を眺めていると、\nとても安らいだ気持ちになります……。", "zh": "是的，眺望着夜空，\n会令人感到非常平静……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_4005_p", "source_sha256": "fbd0958591a4fbc173f68286fafc37235448c03483a704377a64483aac7d8ccf", "ja": "そうか。それはきっと……\nあれを思い出すから、かな。", "zh": "这样啊，那一定是因为……\n会使你回忆起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_4006", "source_sha256": "9fdd077b17f960d766dfe58228cde436b44a70751bdaf9732b30cf66388a08b8", "ja": "大切な人達を", "zh": "珍视的人们", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_4007", "source_sha256": "c9ba1fd04b65c2ed4d3e18780af7e1a0ed356eb39c3b3810198b1bc1a4d0de90", "ja": "遥かな故郷を", "zh": "遥远的故乡", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_4008", "source_sha256": "8d1ad35006c55843a9f73a039e39b2cac7609f07b94e9e7acc8cf2870e6fc618", "ja": "通りすがりの宇宙人を", "zh": "路过的外星人", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_4100_p", "source_sha256": "0ce0a885aa243754a93042fd53eebf3e40502744805cceb39061a0c66213b6d7", "ja": "貴音の、大切な人達のことを。", "zh": "回忆起贵音珍视的那些人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_4101_008tak", "source_sha256": "52bd077ab36384c402f212060c5a1968fa1064536bfa6062e03e14e4efdcce8b", "ja": "そうですね。自然と目に浮かんでくるのです。\n私をいつも見守ってくれる、私の大切な人々……。", "zh": "是的，眼前自然而就会浮现，\n总是守护着小女子的那些珍视的人们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_4102_008tak", "source_sha256": "f101e315390a19be3c65a80494012e419e4d03a021faf0c57b18c3b6df7854f6", "ja": "声援を送ってくれるファンの皆様。\n劇場の仲間たち……。", "zh": "一直为小女子声援的粉丝们。\n剧场的伙伴们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_4103_008tak", "source_sha256": "3e445b34c7d996257f87b91e221ece544bc99c0b24dff96bb018ce5e87ddbd16", "ja": "支えてくださるたくさんの方達に、\n私は、感謝しなくてはいけませんね。", "zh": "有这么多人支持着小女子，\n小女子必须心怀感谢才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_4104_p", "source_sha256": "7a42db176dea5ba8701f1c9df27bf580c6ba70959dc0fc083f665a55bb060766", "ja": "……そんな気持ちがこめられているせいかな。\n貴音のナレーションは、聞いていて心地いいよ。", "zh": "……或许是贵音的声音怀着这样的情感吧，\n你的解说让人听了觉得很舒服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_4105_008tak", "source_sha256": "e138b08077f1d26baa5359d3ee388bf9c45eb0f36be59daa7255a1bd9fbb9130", "ja": "まぁ、真ですか？　ふふ、光栄なことです。\n私の気持ちは、届いていた……ということですね。", "zh": "哎呀，此言当真？呵呵，真是光荣。\n这就表示小女子的心意……传达到了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_4106_008tak", "source_sha256": "021183826484b8f8160ee2ee9a21f2797408607896eeae6904fb9932d8ec60c8", "ja": "誰よりも感謝している方の心に……。", "zh": "传进了小女子最是感谢的人心里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_4107_p", "source_sha256": "3ea7085295c47065fb51034d5252372bf2f1c4df021a0ed798cc2f2cdf5c150b", "ja": "（眼差しから、貴音の気持ちが伝わってくる。\nこの信頼に、しっかり応えないとな）", "zh": "（贵音的眼神传来了她的心意。\n我得好好回应这份信赖才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_4200_p", "source_sha256": "08f1ee05f9939b63dd9167a6b4318dff5b74c5bb665fbd956cca6f9727c7fd69", "ja": "遥かな故郷のことを。\n……たしか、かなり遠い所だったよな？", "zh": "回忆起遥远的故乡。\n……我记得是相当遥远的地方吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_4201_008tak", "source_sha256": "6be3390092d7e47a3a55e982948c81a920aeb58af437c55531a086821b66ceaa", "ja": "そうですね……。たとえ見ることはできても、\n決して帰ることはできない、この空の彼方……。", "zh": "是啊……那是即使看得见，\n也绝对回不去的地方，就在这片天空的彼端……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_4202_008tak", "source_sha256": "837c7cdb1f6872bafedcb09afc03c992e0811c61ad9e615924d82f2f00a2e656", "ja": "ですが、今の私は……故郷のことばかり\n思い出しているわけではありません。", "zh": "但是，现在的小女子……\n并非只有回忆起故乡。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_4203_008tak", "source_sha256": "9fdc019ed02c4db9e8bb7cd09ddb75ffa76ab5223143ae62a55df37cc7b2b943", "ja": "……ふふ。いつかまた、お話しいたしましょう。\n私の故郷と、私の……夢のお話を。", "zh": "……呵呵，这事等哪天再和官人说说吧。\n说说小女子的故乡，与小女子的……梦想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_4300_p", "source_sha256": "c480de00d70da89e60e251e214c31fa133f94b1842475e3b509344418273690e", "ja": "通りすがりの宇宙人を……。\nうっかり望遠鏡に写っちゃいました、みたいな。", "zh": "回忆起路过的外星人……\n好像不小心被望远镜给拍到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_4301_008tak", "source_sha256": "d09a33145f32afcb8ac29317db18a3ba072b1f2eecf64a505ecbae4f051c25c4", "ja": "……いったい、何を言っておられるのです、\n{$P$}？", "zh": "……请问你到底在说什么呢？\n{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_4302_008tak", "source_sha256": "72fbe8baea486c5b81b52e0cdfe14c847335b1c5eb9248baee12b3d927616ca5", "ja": "聞くところによると、宇宙人とは、\n灰色の小さなヒトらしき生物だそうですが……。", "zh": "小女子听说，外星人这种生物似乎长得灰暗娇小，\n外型与人类相似……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_4303_008tak", "source_sha256": "9f311cdd975c2ab079e82df5f6f56e4eb572d56c10afdc520e4fdba6e4fd9638", "ja": "はっ……！　もしや{$P$}は、\n見たことがあるのですか！？　いつ、どのように？", "zh": "啊……！莫非{$P$}\n曾经见过吗！？何时？在何种情况下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_4304_p", "source_sha256": "a5bc9270ce91735cd437f40b10e45c6a8da9f134a0bec6122c0c5a69fffdb465", "ja": "い、いや、すまない！　ちょっと言ってみただけで、\nそんなに食いつかれるとは思わなくて……！", "zh": "没、没有，抱歉！我只是说说而已，\n没想到你会这么感兴趣……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
